This private control plane coordinates work performed in independently governed
producer and consumer repositories. It records program decisions, gates,
cross-repository dependencies, immutable artifact identities, and interface
compatibility. It does not contain or execute scientific algorithms.

This README is the repository map and the **sole placement authority**. Read the
marked contract before creating or moving a file. [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) owns
agent permissions; [`AGENTS.local.md`](AGENTS.local.md) holds preserved local
additions.

## Quickstart

```bash
pre-commit install
python scripts/validate_registry.py
mkdocs build --strict
```

Initialize Beads with prefix `{{ registry_prefix }}` in JSONL-only/no-database
mode. `.beads/issues.jsonl` remains the sole status authority; the CLI may also
commit its declarative `config.yaml`, `metadata.json`, `README.md`, and
`interactions.jsonl` support files. Databases, daemon/runtime state, sockets,
locks, logs, and local absolute paths are prohibited.

